   "file": "Q00060_GoodWorksReward/31092-03b.html",
   "quest": 60,
   "text": "Black Marketeer of Mammon: It appears that you have completed all the tests. I will reimburse you the money you spent on the antidote. How much was it again?",
   "header": "Black Marketeer of Mammon",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"It was 300 million Adena. Give me the money now!\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00060_GoodWorksReward REPLY_3",
