   "quest": 60,
   "text": "Black Marketeer of Mammon: Ahhh, I don't actually have the money. But if you're nice to me, I'll be nice to you. Take this money now and I will help you complete your test more quickly. How about it? Hurry up and decide!",
   "header": "Black Marketeer of Mammon",
   "links": [
    {
